If you step on a polymorph trap you will be randomly polymorphed into
some monster. When you are wearing a ring of polymorph control, you can
select which monster you want to polymorph to. When you are wearing
dragon scales or dragon scale mail, you will always polymorph into that
type of dragon.

To avoid it in the future, you should not step on polymorph traps (more
easily said than done). Maybe wearing a ring of polymorph contro will
work (but see my question below).

